{"id":"da3a454fea13ee06","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-pi11-ca0.md","title":"Pi-1-1 Comprehension Axiom","display":"df-pi11-ca0 — Pi-1-1 Comprehension Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-pi11-ca0","aliases":["72-df-pi11-ca0"],"display":"df-pi11-ca0 — Pi-1-1 Comprehension Axiom","depends_on":["[[72-df-base-system]]","[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-pi11-ca0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-pi11-ca0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi11-ca0 — Pi-1-1 Comprehension Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>语言、全称闭包、公式类与证明关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CA}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{CA}_x\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V_S\">\\(X\\in V_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_N\">\\(x\\in V_N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CA}_x(\\varphi,X):\\varphi\\in \\Pi^1_1\\land X\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\land x\\in V_N\\land X\\in V_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CA}_x(\\varphi,X):\\varphi\\in \\Pi^1_1\\land X\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\land x\\in V_N\\land X\\in V_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是元语言中的公理句集合。公式可含其他自由集、数参数；ucl将其全称闭包。有限两类变量演算与全二阶语义须区别。PR函数若需用于序数表示，按保守定义扩展加入，不能改变概括公式类的基本语言定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-base-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言、全称闭包、公式类与证明关系取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\mathsf{RCA}_0$、$\\operatorname{CA}_x$ 见 [[72-df-base-system]]；$X\\in V_S$、$x\\in V_N$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言、全称闭包、公式类与证明关系取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\mathsf{RCA}_0$、$\\operatorname{CA}_x$ 见 [[72-df-base-system]]；$X\\in V_S$、$x\\in V_N$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言、全称闭包、公式类与证明关系取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\mathsf{RCA}_0$、$\\operatorname{CA}_x$ 见 [[72-df-base-system]]；$X\\in V_S$、$x\\in V_N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{RCA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CA}_x","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{CA}_x(\\varphi,X):\\varphi\\in \\Pi^1_1\\land X\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\land x\\in V_N\\land X\\in V_S\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-pi11-ca0|df-pi11-ca0 — Pi-1-1 Comprehension Axiom]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-pi11-ca0|df-pi11-ca0 — Pi-1-1 Comprehension Axiom]]"},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","5ae195683ce3beb4","b63a805280ad1d8e"]}